5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to move our desks! I want to know how it works every morning. Let's find some cool clues first!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"We should be cautious. Before we decide on a layout, we need to understand the financial implications of the floor space.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. We also need to consider the fairness of the seating, as some spots are naturally better than others.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Logic suggests we look at the physical environment. The actual comfort and sound levels of the desks are what really matter.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want us to stay close! I wonder how sitting next to different people changes how we work together.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, is the money really that scary? I want to check the ""Morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs"" and ""Arrival times in the badge records""!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It is a matter of sustainability. I will look into the ""Basis of the department's floor billing"" and ""Facilities quote for re-running power and network.""","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll examine the ""Drawn plan against the staff survey"" and ""Unplanned seat shuffles in the past year"" to see how we've handled this before.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll take the ""Sound meter readings across the room"" and the ""Physio's note from the workstation check."" Comfort isn't optional.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'll check ""Two project strands within earshot last spring"" and ""What this year's two joiners reported"" to see how we bond!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
